    "body": "fix on issue/1339-vouch-fidelity · PR #2821 · pinned by `a_vouched_model_posts_and_its_undo_is_refused_again`, `the_tool_refuses_by_name_and_enters_no_history`, `a_vouched_model_passes_the_gate_and_its_undo_is_refused_again`, `a_recorded_coarse_chord_is_never_vouched_away`, `every_other_bad_input_is_refused_by_name`, `the_record_speaks_only_for_the_facets_it_was_given_for`, `the_vouch_rides_the_project_file`, `model_page_vouches_for_an_unknown_mesh_and_undo_brings_the_row_back` · merges at the next cut\n\nNotes:\n\n- The PR is a `feat`: it adds the command `VouchModelFidelity`, the MCP tool `vouch_model_fidelity` and the model page row.\n- The row for the tool in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` is not in the PR. The session could not write to that path. A session that can write process files must add the row.\n- The decision record is `docs/decisions/1339-vouch-fidelity.md`.\n",
